OL,3,GNEWSAKnife allegedly pulled on cyclist
OL,4,Ain road rage incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey Police are appealing for
OL,7,Fwitnesses following a road rage
OL,8,Fincident.
OL,10,FThe force said the driver of a black
OL,11,Fcar reportedly threatened a cyclist
OL,12,Fwith a knife in Gomshall.
OL,14,FIt described the driver as a White man
OL,15,Faged between 30 and 40, who was around
OL,16,F5'8" (173cm) tall and slim, with long,
OL,17,Fwiry blond hair and a blond beard. He
OL,18,Fwas wearing a black tracksuit top, with
OL,19,Fblack tracksuit bottoms with pink
OL,20,Fspots, police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
